{"id": "1439458", "name": "מכפלה סטנדרטית בין וקטורים מרוכבים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randcomplex", "params": ["n"], "body": "block(\n    [re, im],\n    re: rand_with_prohib(-n, n, [0]),\n    im: rand_with_prohib(-n, n, [0]),\n    re + im*%i\n)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונים הווקטורים המרוכבים</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[v_1= {{CT:0}}, \\; v_2= {{CT:1}}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו את המכפלה הסקלרית (הסטנדרטית) שלהם. תזכורת המכפלה הסטנדרטית במרוכבים מוגדרת:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\left(\\begin{array}{c}a_{1}\\\\\\vdots\\\\a_{n}\\end{array}\\right)\\cdot\\left(\\begin{array}{c}b_{1}\\\\\\vdots\\\\b_{n}\\end{array}\\right)=a_{1}\\cdot\\overline{b_{1}}+\\cdots+a_{n}\\cdot\\overline{b_{n}}\\]</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(v_1\\cdot v_2= \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-complex\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: את היחידה המדומה \\(i\\) מזינים באות <code dir=\"ltr\">i</code> (אפשר גם <code dir=\"ltr\">%i</code>), וכפל מסמנים בכוכבית. למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">3-2*i</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["dot_product", "m", "n", "ta", "v1", "v2"], "nvariants": 50}